<title>USA: Smith Barney wins $47 mln Cherokee County, S.C.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney wins $47 mln Cherokee County, S.C.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $47 million Cherokee County District #1 of Cherokee County, S.C., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.05 percent.</p>
</text>
